WEBVTT

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:32.180
Thank you.

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:26.240
the upper left seems to be deserted queen he'll have control of the palace we'll be able to get

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:29.770
out of here try to handle the controls

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:37.000
The queen broke her promise. She isn't going to let us out the door.

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:38.520
She's trying to kill us.

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:40.060
We'll have to find another way out.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:05.840
Stand by for orders from the region.

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:35.430
Yes, my lord?

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:44.570
The Regency has commissioned me to explain and demonstrate your new weapon.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:50.310
While its power is less, of course, than the giant machine located at Revolutionary Headquarters,

00:04:51.010 --> 00:04:55.270
you may safely depend upon this to destroy anything any member of Ike encounter.

00:04:55.970 --> 00:04:59.150
For instance, now watch that piece of solid stone.

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:10.320
When it is controlled.

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:33.920
Now, stand still, all of you, or I'll melt you down like wax.

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.560
Tie them up and be quick about it.

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:45.670
To make a single move, don't hesitate to use this ray gun.

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:54.100
We've got to rescue the Queen.

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:05.400
Go on in one of those boxes, though.

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:06.140
All right, come on.

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:13.740
Whatever.

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:21.710
What are you going after the Queen for?

00:06:21.890 --> 00:06:23.630
The only way we'll ever be able to get out of here.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:28.130
As long as the revolutionists are in power, the surface entrance will never be open.

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:29.960
Where's this one going?

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.640
This one to the radio reviving chamber.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:34.580
That one to the lion pit.

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:43.100
Order him for revival.

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:46.810
Send this one to the lion pit.

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:10.760
Man will live. Tag him for the reviving chamber.

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:21.320
This one, too. Tag him for an extra heavy electric charge.

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:29.820
This one for the lime pits.

00:08:03.570 --> 00:08:06.880
I condemn you to the death chamber.

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:09.540
Take him away.

00:08:10.140 --> 00:08:23.940
My good friend, Mal.

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:26.180
Finish out of the room.

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:29.240
It is a pleasure to...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:47.690
condemn you to death we've got to get to the control room

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:11.210
That makes this load a lot lighter.

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:06.160
Is it going all right?

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:08.110
Perhaps I'm applying too much power.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:08.870
No, Mr. Moon.

00:10:09.010 --> 00:10:09.790
Not to touch me.

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:11.660
Give it a little bit more.

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:42.680
My good queen, you will see some of your faithful followers.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.900
Enjoy the very death to which you have sent so many.

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:48.830
Build up 200,000 volts.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.420
Prisoners in the death chamber.

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:53.550
Always prepared.

00:10:53.910 --> 00:10:54.370
Proceed.

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:06.180
Execute!

00:11:10.990 --> 00:11:13.370
We have the end of your royal concert.

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:20.300
In honor of your good friend, Mal, we shall witness his end from the television screen.

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:27.670
See?

00:11:28.550 --> 00:11:29.970
Mal is entering the...

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:37.930
Why don't you look? This is the last time you will ever see your faithful conager.

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:40.130
Execute!

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:48.700
Look, and you will now see Mal's remains being carried away to the Cavern of the Doom.

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:51.790
I trust you are enjoying this.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:54.640
A queen is not afraid of death.

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:57.540
Not even a slow death?

00:11:58.320 --> 00:11:59.900
A death caused by Rab's...

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:24.430
integrating atom smashing machine not even that lead me away they're taking the queen to her death

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:28.520
at rebel headquarters we've got to save her but how are you going to do it i'll get the rebel

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:29.760
headquarters through the chute

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:30.840
from the death chamber.

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:33.070
You've got to open the trap door for me.

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:33.490
How?

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:35.890
Climb through the window to the control room.

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:38.310
Count 200, and by that time I'll be there.

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:40.450
Then close the switch that opens the trap door.

00:12:40.550 --> 00:12:40.730
Hurry.

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:43.140
But which switch is it?

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:44.820
It's the one with three blades

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:46.200
in the center of the control board.

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:47.220
With teeth.

00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:52.630
Five, six, 27, 28, 29, 30, 31.

00:13:04.990 --> 00:13:27.060
T-t-t-t-t-9, T-t-t-t-t-t-

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:29.980
You have-

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:36.920
being the first. The first to test the life-destroying power of my disintegrating, atom-smashing ray.

00:13:37.610 --> 00:13:44.310
When turned on full force, this machine is capable of destroying all civilization. For instance...

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:07.070
The disintegrator is capable of reducing this to a transparent gas in the twinkling of an eye.

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:24.810
What is to happen to you?

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:26.450
I shall start the machines.

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:36.600
You were turned on you, you were suffering pain, but all feeling would stop more if the

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:39.940
knot was turned to this, because you would be paralyzed.

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:46.220
Now the very atoms of your body would be disintegrated.

00:14:47.140 --> 00:14:51.430
It would give me pleasure if the same were to happen to you.

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:53.280
But it won't.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:01.670
I never heard her scream.

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:22.990
We gotta open the trap door to let Gene into Rebel Headquarters.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:25.340
Pop forgot what switch he said.

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:27.640
Maybe it's this one.

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:36.170
How can you close the switch? It's already closed. You've done the wrong thing.

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:41.900
Boy, it can't be that one. He didn't say it had two blades.

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:53.310
You gotta find the switch that opens the trap door.

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:55.770
What are we gonna do? Let's fire all of them.

00:16:45.292 --> 00:16:46.932
I guess we got the right one.
